bredbrands/projects" target="_blank" rel="noopener"> <span class="bb-navbar-social-title"> <span data-text="Behance">Behance</span> </span> </a></div></div><div class="bb-navbar-mgrid-col -book"><div class="bb-navbar-book"> <a class="bb-btn bb-btn_book" href="/contact/"> <span class="bb-btn_book-title"> <span data-text=""> Work with us </span> </span> </a></div></div><div class="bb-navbar-mgrid-col -email"> <a class="bb-btn bb-btn_full" href="mailto:hello@bornandbredbrand.com"> <span class="bb-btn_full-fill -primary"></span> <span class="bb-btn_full-title"> <span data-text="hello@bornandbredbrand.com">hello@bornandbredbrand.com</span> </span> </a></div></div></div></div></div></header><main id="view-main" style="background:#ffffff;" ><section class="bb-preview"><div class="bb-preview-container"><div class="bb-preview-media"> <picture> <img src="https://bornandbredbrand.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/3840x2160_born-bred-brand-agency-villa-23-1.jpg.webp"  loading="lazy" alt width="1920" height="1080"> </picture></div></div></section><section class="bb-overview" ><div class="bb-overview-container"><div class="bb-overview-hgrid"><div class="bb-overview-hgrid-col -left"><div class="bb-overview-header"><h1 class="h2"> Villa <span class="bb-overview-headline">Launching a housing brand powering 500+ ADUs across California.</span></h1></div></div><div class="bb-overview-hgrid-col -right"><div class="bb-overview-award"><div class="bb-award"><div class="bb-award-item"><div class="bb-award-item-path"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 200 200"> <text> <textPath href="#intouch-text-path" startoffset="60" baseline-shift="7" textLength="465"> Customer Obsessed&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<tspan
fill="red">&bull;</tspan>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Customer Obsessed&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<tspan fill="red">&bull; </tspan>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </textPath> </text> </svg></div><div class="bb-award-item-figure"> <picture> <img src="https://bornandbredbrand.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/bb-website-badges-customer-obsessed.png.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Customer Obsessed"> </picture></div></div><div class="bb-award-item"><div class="bb-award-item-path"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 200 200"> <text> <textPath href="#intouch-text-path" startoffset="60" baseline-shift="7" textLength="465"> Bold & Ambitious&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<tspan
fill="red">&bull;</tspan>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bold & Ambitious&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<tspan fill="red">&bull; </tspan>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </textPath> </text> </svg></div><div class="bb-award-item-figure"> <picture> <img src="https://bornandbredbrand.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/bb-website-badges-bold-ambitious.png.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Bold & Ambitious"> </picture></div></div><div class="bb-award-item"><div class="bb-award-item-path"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 200 200"> <text> <textPath href="#intouch-text-path" startoffset="60" baseline-shift="7" textLength="465"> Category Defining&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<tspan
fill="red">&bull;</tspan>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Category Defining&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<tspan fill="red">&bull; </tspan>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </textPath> </text> </svg></div><div class="bb-award-item-figure"> <picture> <img src="https://bornandbredbrand.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/bb-website-badges-category-defining.png.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Category Defining"> </picture></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bb-overview-grid"><div class="bb-overview-grid-col -problem"><div class="bb-overview-info"><div class="bb-overview-title"><h3>Problem</h3></div><div class="bb-overview-text"><p>The housing crisis has made homeownership increasingly out of reach—rising rents, limited supply, and outdated zoning laws have pushed people out of the neighborhoods they love. Villa saw an opportunity in what others overlooked: the backyard. Their vision was to unlock underutilized space to solve for modern housing needs with stylish, efficient accessory dwelling units (ADUs). But to bring that vision to life, they needed a name, brand, and website that could rally both homeowners and policymakers around a bold new housing movement</p></div></div></div><div class="bb-overview-grid-col -scope"><div class="bb-overview-caption"> <i>🔭</i><h3>Scope</h3></div><div class="bb-overview-text"><ul class="-plain"><li>Naming</li><li>Strategy & Positioning</li><li>Brand Identity</li><li>Messaging</li><li>Website Design</li></ul></div></div><div class="bb-overview-grid-col -solution"><div class="bb-overview-info"><div class="bb-overview-title"><h3>Solution</h3></div><div class="bb-overview-text"><p data-start="729" data-end="1228">We partnered with Villa from the ground up—literally. We developed the name “Villa” and crafted a brand system that felt as warm and welcoming as the homes they build. The brand identity reflected their core values of simplicity, accessibility, and design-forward living, while the launch website translated a complex offering into a clear and inspiring homeowner journey. Together, we helped position Villa not just as a product, but as a purpose-driven company reshaping what home can be.</p><p data-start="729" data-end="1228"><a href="https://villahomes.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Visit Villa Here →</strong></a></p></div></div></div><div class="bb-overview-grid-col -client"><div class="bb-overview-caption"></div></div><div class="bb-overview-grid-col -press"><div class="bb-overview-caption"></div></div><div class="bb-overview-grid-col -results"><div class="bb-overview-caption"> <i>📊️</i><h3>Results</h3></div><div class="bb-overview-counters"><div class="bb-overview-counter"><div class="bb-overview-counter-value">40</div><div class="bb-overview-counter-unit">M</div><div class="bb-overview-counter-title">Venture Funding</div></div><div class="bb-overview-counter"><div class="bb-overview-counter-value">500</div><div class="bb-overview-counter-unit">+</div><div class="bb-overview-counter-title">Homes Sold</div></div><div class="bb-overview-counter"><div class="bb-overview-counter-value">100</div><div class="bb-overview-counter-unit">+</div><div class="bb-overview-counter-title">Local Jurisdictions</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bb-preview"><div class="bb-preview-container"><div class="bb-preview-media"> <picture> <img src="https://bornandbredbrand.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/3840x2160_born-and-bred-brand-agency-07-1920x1920-1.jpg.webp"  loading="lazy" alt width="1920" height="1080"> </picture></div></div></section><section class="bb-preview"><div class="bb-preview-container"><div class="bb-preview-media"> <picture> <img src="https://bornandbredbrand.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/3840x2160_born-and-bred-brand-agency-08-1920x1920-1-1.jpg.webp"  loading="lazy" alt width="1920" height="1080"> </picture></div></div></section><section class="bb-preview"><div class="bb-preview-container"><div class="bb-preview-media"> <picture> <img src="https://bornandbredbrand.com/wp-conten